window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Unhinged. Charming. Dangerous.</p> <p>The brother of the man I’m prosecuting and now my stalker.</p> <p>I didn’t know Eoghan O’Rourke was a lawyer for the Irish Mob when I tried to put his brother in jail.</p> <p>And I shouldn’t have gotten drunk and yelled at him.</p> <p>I certainly shouldn’t have gone home with him.</p> <p>But I needed to get rid of my V-Card and a gorgeous mafia man who would never fall for a curvy woman like me is the perfect one and done.</p> <p>Boy, was I wrong.</p> <p>Eoghan turns obsessed, jealous, and unhinged.</p> <p>I’m a prosecutor.</p> <p>He’s a criminal.</p> <p>We have nothing in common.</p> <p>And every reason in the world to stay enemies.</p> <p>But when the Cosa Nostra targets me, Eoghan makes the ultimate sacrifice to save me.</p> <p>Only, falling for a mob lawyer is the real danger I can’t escape.</p>"; 
